# Taxonomy Invariants

- Every edge must pass the IS-A test: "X is a type of Y"
- MECE: siblings are Mutually Exclusive and Collectively Exhaustive
- No chains: every non-leaf node must have 2+ children
- Max depth: 7 levels from root
- Fanout: 2–15 children per non-leaf node
- Node IDs: `lowercase_snake_case`, globally unique
- Required fields per node: `id`, `name`, `description`
- If composite score drops > 0.02 from previous iteration → ralph.sh will ROLL BACK your changes
- ALWAYS verify edges with embedder CLI before adding: `$PYTHON tools/check_edge.py --batch '[...]'`
